9,"h":38,"s":26,"a":122,"sd":null},{"k":"26:123","t":"ʿAad denied the messengers","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":123,"sd":null},{"k":"26:124","t":"When their brother Hūd said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":124,"sd":null},{"k":"26:125","t":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":125,"sd":null},{"k":"26:126","t":"So fear Allāh and obey me.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":126,"sd":null},{"k":"26:127","t":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":127,"sd":null},{"k":"26:128","t":"Do you construct on every elevation a sign, amusing yourselves,","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":128,"sd":null},{"k":"26:129","t":"And take for yourselves constructions [i.e., palaces and fortresses] that you might abide eternally?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":129,"sd":null},{"k":"26:130","t":"And when you strike, you strike as tyrants.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":130,"sd":null},{"k":"26:131","t":"So fear Allāh and obey me.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":131,"sd":null},{"k":"26:132","t":"And fear He who provided you with that which you know,","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":132,"sd":null},{"k":"26:133","t":"Provided you with grazing livestock and children","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":133,"sd":null},{"k":"26:134","t":"And gardens and springs.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":134,"sd":null},{"k":"26:135","t":"Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a terrible day.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":135,"sd":null},{"k":"26:136","t":"They said, \"It is all the same to us whether you advise or are not of the advisors.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":136,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}